# =============================================================================
# Local firewall overrides — starter pack
# =============================================================================
# Copy to `domains.local.txt` (gitignored), then uncomment what you need.
# Accepts the same extended syntax as `domains.txt` (see the header of
# `domains.txt` for the 5 supported formats + the `!disable` override).
#
# Precedence : domains.local.txt > policy.d/ > domains.txt > defaults.
# A line that mentions a host already present in baseline REDEFINES it
# (the paths committed for that host are wiped). To extend without wiping,
# don't use this layer — write `policy.local.d/<host>.yaml` instead.
#
# At boot, `init-firewall.sh` logs a WARN for every override applied.
# Machine-readable trace : `runtime._overrides_applied` in `policy.compiled.yaml`.
# =============================================================================


# ─── Disable telemetry (test offline / debug network) ────────────────────────
# Disables POSTs to statsig + sentry. Claude Code still works without them,
# but error reports won't reach Anthropic.
#
# !disable *.statsig.com
# !disable *.sentry.io


# ─── Project example template (copy-paste, edit per project) ─────────────────
# Hosts of the project hosted in this devcontainer (not Claude Code itself).
# Replace example.com with your project's main domain.
#
# example.com
# api.example.com
# static.example.com


# ─── AI alternatives (test concurrent models from Claude Code) ───────────────
# Sub-agents that consume other providers (OpenRouter, Kimi, etc.).
#
# [GET,POST] *.opencode.ai
# [GET,POST] *.kimi.com
# [GET,POST] openrouter.ai
# huggingface.co
# *.hf.space


# ─── Doc sites (read public documentation) ───────────────────────────────────
# Uncomment by group depending on what you're coding.
#
# developer.mozilla.org                  # MDN Web Docs (HTML/CSS/JS)
# www.php.net                            # PHP manual
# nodejs.org                             # Node.js docs
# docs.python.org                        # Python stdlib
# pkg.go.dev                             # Go packages


# ─── Package registries (other ecosystems) ───────────────────────────────────
# Widens the scope beyond the @anthropic-ai/* path committed in baseline.
#
# [GET,HEAD] registry.npmjs.org          # ⚠️ REDEFINE — wipes the /@anthropic-ai/* path filter
# [GET,HEAD] repo.packagist.org          # Composer (PHP)
# [GET,HEAD] files.pythonhosted.org      # pip
# [GET,HEAD] pypi.org                    # pip index (JSON API)
# [GET,HEAD] crates.io                   # Rust
# [GET,HEAD] static.crates.io            # Rust tarballs


# ─── GitHub public (orgs other than anthropics) ──────────────────────────────
# ⚠️ This section EXTENDS the committed GitHub surface (which restricts to
# /anthropics/*). Full REDEFINE on the hosts → wipes baseline paths.
#
# [GET,POST] github.com                  # ⚠️ wipes baseline /anthropics/*
# [GET] api.github.com                   # ⚠️ wipes baseline /repos/anthropics/*
# [GET] codeload.github.com
# [GET] raw.githubusercontent.com


# ─── Search ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# [GET] duckduckgo.com
# [GET] html.duckduckgo.com
